{
 "id": "seg5",
 "title": "停链与回滚",
 "pill": 5,
 "total": 100.46,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5-00",
   "text": "链也可能整条停下。",
   "spoken": "链也可能整条停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 3.399
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "活性，是链能继续处理新交易。",
   "spoken": "活性，是链能继续楚理新交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-01.wav",
   "start": 3.82,
   "dur": 2.72,
   "speechStart": 3.82,
   "speechEnd": 6.286
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "安全性，是已经确认的结果不被推翻。",
   "spoken": "安全性，是已经确认的结果不被推翻。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-02.wav",
   "start": 6.76,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 6.857,
   "speechEnd": 10.118
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "2021 年 9 月，一次代币发行引来机器人交易洪泛。",
   "spoken": "2021 年 9 月，一次代币发行引来机器人交易洪泛。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-03.wav",
   "start": 10.58,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 10.58,
   "speechEnd": 15.369
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "Solana 验证者内存溢出，全网停止出块约 17 小时。",
   "spoken": "Solana 验证者内存溢出，全网停止出块约 17 小时。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-04.wav",
   "start": 15.84,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 15.84,
   "speechEnd": 20.313
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "2022 年 10 月，BSC 上的跨链桥被伪造证明攻击。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 10 月，BSC 上的跨链桥被伪造证明攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-05.wav",
   "start": 20.78,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 20.881,
   "speechEnd": 25.15
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "BNB Chain 要求验证者暂停出块，新版本冻结了攻击者地址。",
   "spoken": "BNB Chain 要求验证者暂停出块，新版本冻结了攻击者地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-06.wav",
   "start": 25.56,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 25.668,
   "speechEnd": 30.94
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "验证者少的链，可以在几小时内协调停链、冻结，甚至回滚。",
   "spoken": "验证者少的链，可以在几小时内协条停链、冻结，甚至回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-07.wav",
   "start": 31.38,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 31.38,
   "speechEnd": 36.659
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "这能救急，也说明这条链的不可篡改，是有前提的。",
   "spoken": "这能救急，也说明这条链的不可篡改，是有前提的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-08.wav",
   "start": 37.04,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 37.134,
   "speechEnd": 41.408
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "L2 的排序器，通常由一个运营方负责出块。",
   "spoken": "L2 的排序器，通常由一个运营方负责出块。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-09.wav",
   "start": 41.82,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 41.919,
   "speechEnd": 45.392
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "它刚出的 unsafe 头，只是排序器的承诺，可以被回滚。",
   "spoken": "它刚出的 unsafe 头，只是排序器的承诺，可以被回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-10.wav",
   "start": 45.8,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 45.8,
   "speechEnd": 49.658
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 升级后停链，并两次回滚。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 9 月，Starknet 升级后停链，并两次回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-11.wav",
   "start": 50.1,
   "dur": 4.56,
   "speechStart": 50.205,
   "speechEnd": 54.493
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-12",
   "text": "第二次回滚掉约 20 分钟的交易。",
   "spoken": "第二次回滚掉约 20 分钟的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-12.wav",
   "start": 54.88,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 54.971,
   "speechEnd": 57.278
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-13",
   "text": "如果交易所按 unsafe 头入账，用户随即提走，块又被回滚。",
   "spoken": "如果交易所按 unsafe 头入账，用户随即提走，块又被回滚。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-13.wav",
   "start": 57.66,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 57.752,
   "speechEnd": 62.934
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "这笔损失，由交易所承担。",
   "spoken": "这笔损失，由交易所承担。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-14.wav",
   "start": 63.32,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 63.418,
   "speechEnd": 65.276
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "所以大额要等 L1 上最终确定的批次。",
   "spoken": "所以大额要等 L1 上最终确定的批次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-15.wav",
   "start": 65.7,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 65.7,
   "speechEnd": 69.071
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-16",
   "text": "排序器宕机时，用户可以通过 L1 合约，强制提交交易。",
   "spoken": "排序器宕机时，用户可以通过 L1 合约，强制提交交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-16.wav",
   "start": 69.52,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 69.52,
   "speechEnd": 74.214
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-17",
   "text": "最后一种资源，是别人的动机。",
   "spoken": "最后一种资源，是别人的动机。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-17.wav",
   "start": 74.62,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 74.62,
   "speechEnd": 77.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-18",
   "text": "2020 年 3 月的 Steem 事件，报道称 Huobi、Binance 和 Poloniex，用托管的客户 STEEM 投票。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 3 月的 Steem 事件，报道称 Huobi、Binance 和 Poloniex，用托管的客户 STEEM 投票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-18.wav",
   "start": 77.48,
   "dur": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 77.48,
   "speechEnd": 85.29
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-19",
   "text": "帮助 Justin Sun 控制了见证人席位，Huobi 承认动用了客户资金。",
   "spoken": "帮助 Justin Sun 控制了见证人席位，Huobi 承认动用了客户资金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-19.wav",
   "start": 85.7,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 85.798,
   "speechEnd": 90.504
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-20",
   "text": "交易所的托管资产，本身就是共识权力。",
   "spoken": "交易所的托管资产，本身就是共识权力。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-20.wav",
   "start": 90.96,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 90.96,
   "speechEnd": 94.403
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-21",
   "text": "客户资产默认不参与投票，例外要有书面授权。",
   "spoken": "客户资产默认不参与投票，例外要有书面授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg5-21.wav",
   "start": 94.86,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 94.86,
   "speechEnd": 99.046
  }
